      48.81,
      391.69,
      539.85,
      414.76
    ],
    "text": "THE institute \u201cApe Gama\u201d has been entrusted under the purview of the Minister of Education by Gazette ExtraordinaryNotification No 1933/13 dated 21.09.2015 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      427.69,
      539.88,
      450.76
    ],
    "text": "The administration,financial management and governance of \u201cApe Gama\u201d has been entrusted to a Governing Boardconsisted of the members as appearing in the attached schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      421.41,
      463.69,
      534.19,
      486.76
    ],
    "text": "AKILA VIRAJ KARIYAWASAM,Minister of Education.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      499.69,
      191.01,
      546.76
    ],
    "text": "Ministry of Education,\u201cIsurupaya\u201d,Battaramulla,On the 16th day of February 2016,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      268.29,
      559.69,
      320.49,
      570.76
    ],
    "text": "SCHEDULE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      142.29,
      583.69,
      446.4,
      594.76
    ],
    "text": "NOTICE REGARDING THE GOVERNING BOARD OF THE INSTITUTE \"APE GAMA\"",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      607.69,
      539.95,
      678.76
    ],
    "text": "The institute \u201cApe Gama\u201d has been entrusted under the purview of the Minister of Education by GazetteExtraordinary No 1933/13 dated 21.09.2015 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.Theadministration,financial management and the governance of the institute \u201cApe Gama\u201d is hereby entrusted to a GoverningBoard consisted in accordance with the provisions provided hereinafter as an interim provision in effect until a formallegal framework is complied to perform the aforementioned functions. The composition and the powers entrusted to theGoverning Board is as stipulated below.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      52.29,
      749.27,
      320.13,
      758.13
    ],
    "text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      72.37,
      516.23,
      93.33
    ],
