  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.43,
      735.04,
      427.85,
      742.79
    ],
    "text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.11,
      113.17,
      378.36,
      124.24
    ],
    "text": "The Governing Council shall be comprised of the following persons: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      104.35,
      129.97,
      421.21,
      141.04
    ],
    "text": "(i) Chairman appointed by the minister in charge of the subject of Education.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      101.35,
      146.77,
      456.01,
      157.84
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Working Director appointed by the minister in charge of the subject of Education",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      98.35,
      163.57,
      455.39,
      174.64
    ],
    "text": "(iii) 04 other members appointed by the minister in charge of the subject of Education",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      100.15,
      180.37,
      344.36,
      191.44
    ],
    "text": "(iv) The following persons who are ex-officio members : -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      125.95,
      197.17,
      547.25,
      220.24
    ],
    "text": "(a) The Secretary to the Ministry under the purview of the minister in charge of the subject of Education ora senior officer nominated by the Secretary.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      125.95,
      225.97,
      547.16,
      249.04
    ],
    "text": "(b) Chief Financial Officer of the Ministry under the purview of the minister in charge of the subject ofEducation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      126.67,
      254.77,
      392.98,
      265.84
    ],
    "text": "(c) An officer nominated by the Secretary of the General Treasury.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.11,
      278.77,
      310.54,
      289.84
    ],
    "text": "The Quorum of board meetings shall be 05 members.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.11,
      302.77,
      324.34,
      313.84
    ],
    "text": "The powers of the Governing Board shall be as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      106.27,
      319.57,
      406.18,
      330.64
    ],
    "text": "(i) Financial management and administration of the institute \u201cApe Gama\u201d .",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      101.35,
      336.37,
      547.2,
      359.44
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Recruitment and administration of officers and the other employees deemed necessary for theimplementation of the functions of the institute.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      101.83,
      365.17,
      526.2,
      376.24
    ],
    "text": "(iii) Preparation, implementation and regulation of plans for the development of the institute \u201cApe Gama\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      101.11,
      381.97,
      511.19,
      393.04
    ],
    "text": "(iv) Establishment and the maintenance of a fund for the execution of powers of the Governing Board.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
